<h2 local-id=3D"72d5c13c471e" id=3D"NewSalesStartDateDefaulting&amp;Overrid=
eRulesinSalesforce-2.RequestSummary">2. Request Summary</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a=
667d446-6934-4a36-882b-15d909f4ddce" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45cd58a5-7740-494c-a7d2-6aa304bafa3c">
<th data-local-id=3D"d34bd003-75d4-4127-aefb-e976f08fedd2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d71269a4a60d">Category</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"dadee176-e0f2-4315-9d2c-2edcb3a019f1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"50b281db4a0f">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d3655824-98bb-4dd6-9692-45c6a2e5cd33">
<td data-local-id=3D"17a7cea0-c538-4775-b7b0-1116faadc369" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"173b8a4fafcf">Business Need</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"141d7458-c674-465a-9367-fb983fc22c80" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0465102bedf7">Define how a <strong>start date</strong> shoul=
d be set for <strong>new sales</strong>, including defaulting logic, the ab=
ility to override frequently, and guardrails to prevent quotes with start d=
ates that have already passed. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://h=
elpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_lay=
outs/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp=
;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=
=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesf=
orce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ec0323d0-7a3c-4147-a0e2-5e6a162a0fce">
<td data-local-id=3D"1da1d0d7-c4d5-40a9-a474-bdd3a09e0c38" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62ba717703f9">Why This Is Needed Now</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6fbfa8b-0eec-4e2d-90c4-c9fd8a9f7d65" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ca8fa248e68">Start date logic impacts customer experience (=
pushback when licenses are sent mid-month for already-passed start dates) a=
nd is needed for UAT/go-live readiness. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"=
https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems=
_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505=
AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&a=
mp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R=
...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0035a318-219d-4d8e-80a2-a6c6fd2f8e74">
<td data-local-id=3D"718e94f0-d317-4918-9762-10b4160d606d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e3929a897090">Who Is Impacted</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"52b90c7f-dc16-437d-a2bf-b2408d95d846" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d2238ce9fda">Operations teams processing orders; Sales user=
s creating quotes; customers affected by start date alignment and license t=
iming. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepo=
int.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourced=
oc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requi=
rement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobilered=
irect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td=
>
</tr>
