<h2 local-id=3D"ec4d43b9e9bb" id=3D"NewSalesStartDateDefaulting&amp;Overrid=
eRulesinSalesforce-3.Scope">3. Scope</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6=
7b5d13f-68dc-4a95-b48c-e6e926130680" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"90d738f7-ef98-4bab-8313-6293bed0e8a6">
<th data-local-id=3D"3be2c561-5891-45de-b220-3844f40b16d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"59dc130f2842">Scope Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c22058c2-a5b3-4945-a294-31fd4918142c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"56d7be9f780d">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dede5daf-bb41-4b6a-99f6-fe904cdfe120">
<td data-local-id=3D"19a1f4a2-6988-4ebc-8314-abf06e60e8f3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e6c4d33dcd45">In Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"faf727e5-7e8d-4963-bde6-4bbcdba9e8fe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d4e5e6f59bc">Default start date rules for new sales quotes;=
 ability to override start date during order processing (before contract cr=
eation); validation/guardrail linking quote expiration to line item start d=
ate to prevent start dates in the past without quote being expired. <a clas=
s=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/person=
al/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC=
40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathe=
ring%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" =
rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"80d790ef-9b6a-4630-93cb-62ad597052d1">
<td data-local-id=3D"38c734d5-bbb3-4994-9cac-18f8a5a3dbfb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c26530547e89">Out of Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"731ab6c9-c017-4531-ba04-6a70aa7e3c65" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"873cd9bbed39">Final decision on whether default should be =
=E2=80=9C1st of current month=E2=80=9D vs =E2=80=9C1st of next month=E2=80=
=9D (requirement captured as pending); any downstream license generation me=
chanics beyond start-date impacts. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/=
_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D=
&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;ac=
tion=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Sa=
lesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"6d297fc9fce5" id=3D"NewSalesStartDateDefaulting&amp;Overrid=
eRulesinSalesforce-4.FunctionalRequirements">4. Functional Requirements</h2=
>
<ul local-id=3D"d7a8aae1-0c7c-45c4-b2fe-7e9defbf4a59">
<li local-id=3D"b5b5dc89-e40a-4580-8f93-34a50cfc72aa">
<p local-id=3D"8a7f5a2def69"><strong>FR-1:</strong> The system must apply a=
 <strong>default start date</strong> for new sales quotes based on defined =
business logic (current rule referenced as default to the 1st of the month;=
 alternative rule proposed). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://hel=
psystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layou=
ts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;f=
ile=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=
=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesf=
orce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dcb7e8f2-fab6-4e8d-b134-12c4af671011">
<p local-id=3D"ea9d0ea546e1"><strong>FR-2:</strong> The system must allow o=
perations users to <strong>override</strong> the start date during <strong>=
order processing</strong> (before contract creation). <a class=3D"external-=
link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenth=
er_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-9=
0A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Sal=
esforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollo=
w">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a000b484-f8ac-4176-adc9-078b9ab4c252">
<p local-id=3D"800820e825a8"><strong>FR-3:</strong> The system must prevent=
 scenarios where a quote remains valid when the <strong>line item start dat=
e has already passed</strong>, by enforcing a validation related to quote e=
xpiration vs start date. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsys=
temsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/1=
5/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=
=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Dde=
fault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce =
| Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c7e7fedf-8fdc-4e97-a31e-5af0b214e2c5">
<p local-id=3D"11f0a146d3e3"><strong>FR-4:</strong> The system must enforce=
 that if the quote becomes expired due to the start date passing, users mus=
t <strong>update the start date</strong> (or otherwise correct configuratio=
n) before proceeding. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystem=
sllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/D=
oc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DR=
enewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefaul=
t&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Wo=
rd]</a></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"6760c1b46291" id=3D"NewSalesStartDateDefaulting&amp;Overrid=
eRulesinSalesforce-5.BusinessRules">5. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"229c2beb-818b-4403-ab90-6fa8f1e86d45">
<li local-id=3D"8a0e5950-479e-4198-8cd3-fc32031e5bc2">
<p local-id=3D"6737c5384195"><strong>BR-1:</strong> Proposed defaulting rul=
e: if the date is within the <strong>first ~5 days</strong> of the month, d=
efault start date to the <strong>1st of the current month</strong>; if afte=
r that, default to the <strong>1st of the next month</strong>. (Proposed; n=
ot yet confirmed.) <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsll=
c-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.=
aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRene=
wals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&a=
mp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]=
</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"749fa9b7-c097-4a3e-9459-284077c109ca">
<p local-id=3D"3a86481db5e7"><strong>BR-2:</strong> Start date overrides mu=
st be available once the record is handed to operations for processing and =
must occur <strong>before contract creation</strong>. <a class=3D"external-=
link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenth=
er_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-9=
0A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Sal=
esforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollo=
w">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"79e09b28-1dcb-4013-a452-1a7cb1ea8901">
<p local-id=3D"8e7ac7aa8822"><strong>BR-3:</strong> =E2=80=9CA quote expira=
tion date can=E2=80=99t exceed line item start date.=E2=80=9D (Validation r=
ule requirement stated in discussion.) <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"h=
ttps://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_=
com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505A=
B%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&am=
p;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R.=
..Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
