<h2 local-id=3D"a9b2408652c4" id=3D"NewSalesStartDateDefaulting&amp;Overrid=
eRulesinSalesforce-10.AcceptanceCriteria">10. Acceptance Criteria</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"c9e28984-b12b-4257-8ff5-6f154b8406df">
<li local-id=3D"5fe8d930-bfe9-475a-8c61-f81a1449c80d">
<p local-id=3D"7705466aeb4a"><strong>AC-1:</strong> For a new sales quote c=
reated on a date that matches the defined defaulting rule, the system sets =
the start date to the expected default (e.g., current month vs next month p=
er rule). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.shar=
epoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sour=
cedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Re=
quirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobile=
redirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"6a758b42-b308-42e7-b7b3-d6e74f53bd5c">
<p local-id=3D"35f32aa34678"><strong>AC-2:</strong> An operations user can =
update/override the start date during order processing prior to contract cr=
eation, and the saved value is retained. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D=
"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystem=
s_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD50=
5AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&=
amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals =
R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28fa4ae9-ddac-4c45-a766-34c7542ceb29">
<p local-id=3D"30b8cbcc2d2b"><strong>AC-3:</strong> If the line item start =
date is earlier than allowed by quote expiration logic, the system prevents=
 progression and indicates the quote is expired / requires start date corre=
ction. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepo=
int.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourced=
oc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requi=
rement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobilered=
irect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li=
>
</ul>
